Domain Entity ApplicationEvent
  documentation "The life cycle event associated with an application."
  date EventDate
    documentation "The date of the application event, or begin date if an interval. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
    is part of identity
  date EventEndDate
    documentation "The end date of the event, if an interval. Note: Date interpretation may vary. Ed-Fi recommends inclusive dates, but states may define dates as inclusive or exclusive. For calculations, align with local guidelines."
    is optional
  shared integer SequenceNumber
    documentation "The sequence number of the application events. This is used to discriminate between mutiple events of the same type in the same day."
    is part of identity
  descriptor ApplicationEventType
    documentation "Description of the application event."
    is part of identity
  decimal ApplicationEvaluationScore
    documentation "The evaluation score for the application, if applicable."
    is optional
    total digits 36
    decimal places 18
  descriptor ApplicationEventResult
    documentation "The recommendation, result or conclusion of the application event."
    is optional
  domain entity Application
    documentation "Reference to the application associated with the application event."
    is part of identity
  enumeration SchoolYear
    documentation "The identifier for the school year."
    is required
  descriptor Term
    documentation "Defines the term of a session during the school year."
    is optional
